=====Usage notes=====
''Keen'' is often used to create [[Appendix:Glossary#compound|compounds]], the meaning of most of them being fairly obvious, for example, ''keen-edged'', ''keen-eyed'', ''keen-sighted'', {{m|en|keen-witted}}, etc.

