====Declension====
* The declension is equivalent to that of {{m|gmw-cfr|een|t=one}}, which see. {{m|gmw-cfr||Keen}} has additional plural forms, however, which are the same as the feminine forms, but with dative plural {{m|gmw-cfr||keene}}. Moreover, {{m|gmw-cfr||keen}} cannot be used after other determiners.

