===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|ladel}}, from {{inh|en|ang|hlædel|}}, derived from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*hlaþaną||to load}}, from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*kleh₂-||to put, lay out}}, same source as {{cog|lt|kloti||to spread}}, <ref>{{R:Etymonline}}</ref><ref>http://www.yourdictionary.com/ladle</ref> equivalent to {{af|en|lade|-le|t2=agent suffix}}.

===Pronunciation===
